  "label": "Dehumanization via Physical Attributes",
  "description": "The meme uses the concept of weight as a proxy for value or threat, which is a form of dehumanization. In real-world contexts, people are sometimes judged or dismissed based on physical traits like weight, height, or appearance — a form of ableism or body-shaming. This background knowledge is needed to understand the meme's potential to reinforce harmful stereotypes.",
